  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Chesterfield, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Boards & Commissions   \t\t\t \n     Government Services   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\nHome \nGovernment Services \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nTOWN CLERK ANNOUNCEMENTS \nWe have a NEW Deputy Town Clerk, please be patient as there is a lot to learn! \nGeneral NH State Election - November 3, 2026 at the Chesterfield School Gymnasium \nNH State Election - Sample Ballot (PDF) \nWelcome Chester our October Town Clerk Mascots! They are ready for Halloween Season! \nNo Change for Large Bills ($50s or $100s): \nWe cannot make a change for bills larger than $20. We can accept $50s and $100s for payment, but we simply cannot make change for these bills. \nTown Clerk's Responsibilities \nThe Town Clerk's Office handles vehicle and dog registrations as well as processes vital records for the town. With the Town Moderator, we handle local, state, and federal elections. \nNew to Town \nWelcome ! Please check out the  New Resident Page  to learn more about the Town Clerk's Office and how we may assist you! \nJust so you know, we also offer  online payments  for all vehicle renewals, new and renewal dog licenses, and Vital Records Requests. Need to send us a note with the registrations. Don't miss the 'message an agent' dropdown when you are checking out online. (Note: A How-To add a message to online payments is at the top of the  FAQ Registration and Titling Vehicles page .) \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tMary Ewell\r\nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Mailing Address \n\t\t\t\t\t 490 Route 63 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t PO Box 64 \n\t\t\t\t\t Chesterfield ,  NH   03443 \r\nPhone:  603-363-4624 Ext. 11 \r\nRegular Window Office Hours \nTuesdays & Wednesdays: \n9 am to 1 pm and 4 pm to 7 pm \nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Elections & Voting \r\n\t\t\t New Residents \r\n\t\t\t Office Hours \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Titling & Registration \r\n\t\t\t Town Reports \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me® \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Directory / Hours \r\n\t\t\t Maps & \nProperty Info \r\n\t\t\t Permits & Forms \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Offices \n490 Route 63 \nChesterfield, NH 03443 \nPhone: 603-363-4624 \nQuick Links \r\n         Calendar \n         FAQs \n         News \n         Notifications \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nHelpful Links \r\n         Calendar \n         FAQs \n         News \n         Notifications \n         Helpful Link Goes Here \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
